{"The global canManage() implementation incorrectly checks for both VIEW and MANAGE scopes when it should only check for MANAGE scope, making the method too permissive by allowing view-only permissions to pass the management check": 0.9662950038909912, "Iterating over all resources of type Groups and performing full permission evaluation for each causes O(N) performance degradation in realms with many groups that have fine-grained permissions enabled, as hasPermission involves full authorization engine evaluation": 0.8498454689979553}